{"id":"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-iteration.md","title":"Modal Iterations and Relation Powers","display":"df-modal-iteration — Modal Iterations and Relation Powers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-iteration","aliases":["89-df-modal-iteration"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"df-modal-iteration — Modal Iterations and Relation Powers","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-diamond-modality]]","[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","[[89-df-function]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-iteration — Modal Iterations and Relation Powers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e77586c4dc7e03a\" href=\"?note=0e77586c4dc7e03a\" title=\"89-df-diamond-modality\">89-df-diamond-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W\\times W\">\\(R\\subseteq W\\times W\\)</span>；关系幂也允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\varnothing\">\\(W=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^n A,\\Diamond^n A\">\\(\\Box^n A,\\Diamond^n A\\)</span> 是有限句法迭代，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^n\\subseteq (W\\times W)\">\\(R^n\\subseteq (W\\times W)\\)</span> 是下文定义的关系幂。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Box^0A&amp;\\coloneqq A,&amp;\\Box^{n+1}A&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box(\\Box^n A),\\\\\n\\Diamond^0A&amp;\\coloneqq A,&amp;\\Diamond^{n+1}A&amp;\\coloneqq\\Diamond(\\Diamond^n A),\\\\\nR^n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(w,v)\\in (W\\times W)\\mid\\exists s:(n+1)\\to W\\;\n(s_0=w\\land s_n=v\\land\\forall k&lt;n\\ s_kRs_{k+1})\\},\\\\\nR^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R^n,\\qquad\nR^+\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}R^n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Box^0A&amp;\\coloneqq A,&amp;\\Box^{n+1}A&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box(\\Box^n A),\\\\\n\\Diamond^0A&amp;\\coloneqq A,&amp;\\Diamond^{n+1}A&amp;\\coloneqq\\Diamond(\\Diamond^n A),\\\\\nR^n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(w,v)\\in (W\\times W)\\mid\\exists s:(n+1)\\to W\\;\n(s_0=w\\land s_n=v\\land\\forall k&lt;n\\ s_kRs_{k+1})\\},\\\\\nR^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R^n,\\qquad\nR^+\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}R^n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^0=\\{\\langle w,w\\rangle\\mid w\\in W\\},\\quad R^1=R,\\quad R^{n+1}=R^n\\circ R=R\\circ R^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^0=\\{\\langle w,w\\rangle\\mid w\\in W\\},\\quad R^1=R,\\quad R^{n+1}=R^n\\circ R=R\\circ R^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 3–4、72、87–88；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>自然数递归给句法函数的存在唯一性；有限序列集合中的分离给关系幂。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^0\">\\(R^0\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 上恒等关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^1=R\">\\(R^1=R\\)</span>，拼接有限路径给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{n+1}=R^n\\circ R=R\\circ R^n\">\\(R^{n+1}=R^n\\circ R=R\\circ R^n\\)</span>，其中复合按先左后右读。无需传递、序或逆良基假设。此前各原子里的迭代只是局部缩写，本条提供跨节点可复用的统一零次边界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-diamond-modality","status":"resolved","id":"0e77586c4dc7e03a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-diamond-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq W\\times W","display":false},{"tex":"W=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^n A,\\Diamond^n A","display":false},{"tex":"R^n\\subseteq (W\\times W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Box^0A&\\coloneqq A,&\\Box^{n+1}A&\\coloneqq\\Box(\\Box^n A),\\\\\n\\Diamond^0A&\\coloneqq A,&\\Diamond^{n+1}A&\\coloneqq\\Diamond(\\Diamond^n A),\\\\\nR^n&\\coloneqq\\{(w,v)\\in (W\\times W)\\mid\\exists s:(n+1)\\to W\\;\n(s_0=w\\land s_n=v\\land\\forall k<n\\ s_kRs_{k+1})\\},\\\\\nR^*&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R^n,\\qquad\nR^+\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}R^n.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R^0=\\{\\langle w,w\\rangle\\mid w\\in W\\},\\quad R^1=R,\\quad R^{n+1}=R^n\\circ R=R\\circ R^n.","display":true},{"tex":"R^0","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"R^1=R","display":false},{"tex":"R^{n+1}=R^n\\circ R=R\\circ R^n","display":false}],"bytes":1724,"backlinks":[{"id":"3e81fa800505e986","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"59e94f1adddc4fdd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"932deccafc8aeaa8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d8b4548588dec7bd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cdecf2529365d61b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f530ad4c65761317","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84ff5236d2f50db8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f6a587dbcd36439d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"084fa6cdd966d3ef","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"548dca61df509e98","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[